From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Dec 2024 16:30:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] aapt2: add host library for parsing aapt2 protobuf APKs

It's used by arsclib.

(cherry picked from GrapheneOS platform_frameworks_base, branch 17, commit 040c88b56c6a0e454d23afcd356e21b10ad6e42e; LECH OS task E2-11b:
adevtool and tools/arsclib of GrapheneOS need this aapt2 feature)
---
 tools/aapt2/Android.bp | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/aapt2/Android.bp b/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
index 687e7a4c4bea..54ffb5c1bf4f 100644
--- a/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
+++ b/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
@@ -207,6 +207,16 @@ cc_library_static {
     apex_available: ["com.android.webapp"],
 }
 
+java_library_host {
+    name: "aapt2_proto_java",
+    srcs: [
+        "*.proto",
+    ],
+    proto: {
+        type: "full",
+    },
+}
+
 // ==========================================================
 // Build the host tests: aapt2_tests
 // ==========================================================
